+
+                </div>
+              </div>
+            <p>A <code><a href="../Protocols/ResponseSerializer.html">ResponseSerializer</a></code> that performs minimal reponse checking and returns any response data as-is. By default, a
+request returning <code>nil</code> or no data is considered an error. However, if the response is has a status code valid for
+empty responses (<code>204</code>, <code>205</code>), then an empty <code>Data</code> value is returned.</p>
